@TicketBooking.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5267

### Create Event
POST {{TicketBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Music Concert",
  "startsAtUtc": "2027-06-15T18:00:00Z",
  "totalTickets": 10
}

### Create User
POST {{TicketBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### Get All Events
GET {{TicketBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events

### Get Event By Id
GET {{TicketBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/1

### Get All Users
GET {{TicketBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users

### Create Booking
POST {{TicketBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": 1,
    "eventId": 1
}

